{"seq":3,"slug":"barter-settlement-performance-security","title":"易货结算路径与履约保障安排","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/countertrade-barter-offset-operations/barter-clearing-settlement/barter-settlement-performance-security","wordCount":3152,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"易货结算路径与履约保障安排\">易货结算路径与履约保障安排</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念-结算路径与保障工具是一对耦合变量\">核心概念：结算路径与保障工具是一对耦合变量</h2><p>普通跨境贸易里，「怎么付钱」和「对方不履约怎么办」是两个独立问题——前者靠信用证，后者靠银行保函。易货没有这个奢侈：<strong>结算路径本身携带了信用暴露的大小，履约保障工具必须与暴露的形状匹配</strong>，否则再贵的保函也补不上漏洞。</p>\n<p><strong>结算路径（settlement path）</strong> = 净头寸最终以什么资产、在什么时点、经什么渠道被清偿。<strong>履约保障（performance security）</strong> = 一方为「按时、按质、按量交货」提供的可执行承诺。两者的耦合写在一条式子上：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>所需保障额度</mtext><mo>≈</mo><mi>E</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>先交</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{所需保障额度} \\approx E \\times \\rho,\\ E = V_{\\text{先交}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">所需保障额度</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">先交</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 是先履约方在对方交货前的<strong>累计暴露</strong>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span> 是风险系数：现金净额结算最低（0.1–0.3），实物补足最高（0.6–1.0）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[签约: 确定清算价与履约计划] --&gt; B[开立履约保障&lt;br/&gt;SBLC / URDG758 保函 / 保证金]&#10;    B --&gt; C[先履约方开始交货]&#10;    C --&gt; D{滞后方是否按期交货?}&#10;    D -- 是 --&gt; E[双账对冲, 净头寸收敛]&#10;    D -- 否 --&gt; F[触发索偿: 见索即付 or 有条件]&#10;    F --&gt; G[银行垫付 + 向违约方追偿]&#10;    E --&gt; H{净头寸超出摆动额度?}&#10;    H -- 否 --&gt; I[结转下期]&#10;    H -- 是 --&gt; J[按结算路径清偿&lt;br/&gt;现金 / 实物 / 债权转让]\">flowchart TD\n    A[签约: 确定清算价与履约计划] --&gt; B[开立履约保障&lt;br/&gt;SBLC / URDG758 保函 / 保证金]\n    B --&gt; C[先履约方开始交货]\n    C --&gt; D{滞后方是否按期交货?}\n    D -- 是 --&gt; E[双账对冲, 净头寸收敛]\n    D -- 否 --&gt; F[触发索偿: 见索即付 or 有条件]\n    F --&gt; G[银行垫付 + 向违约方追偿]\n    E --&gt; H{净头寸超出摆动额度?}\n    H -- 否 --&gt; I[结转下期]\n    H -- 是 --&gt; J[按结算路径清偿&lt;br/&gt;现金 / 实物 / 债权转让]</pre><p>以双边清算账户为例（记账机制见同章 <a href=\"barter-direct-clearing-account\">直接易货与双边清算账户运作机制</a>），保障工具保护的不是单笔交货，而是<strong>账本上一段时间内累积的净敞口</strong>——这决定保障产品必须能「滚动更新」而非「一单一开」。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>结算路径</th>\n<th>清偿资产</th>\n<th>回款可预测性</th>\n<th>风险系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>匹配的保障工具</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>现金净额结算</td>\n<td>可自由兑换货币</td>\n<td>高（银行清算）</td>\n<td>0.1–0.3</td>\n<td>履约保函 + 保证金账户</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实物补足</td>\n<td>追加货物</td>\n<td>中（依赖对方产能）</td>\n<td>0.4–0.7</td>\n<td>见索即付保函 + 库存质押</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>债权转让（switch）</td>\n<td>第三方受让价款</td>\n<td>低（依赖折价成交）</td>\n<td>0.5–0.8</td>\n<td>债权买断 + 追索权保留</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>产品回购 / 补偿</td>\n<td>对方产出分期货款</td>\n<td>低（产能与市场双不确定）</td>\n<td>0.6–1.0</td>\n<td>母公司担保 + 履约保函组合</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"三条结算路径-现金净额-实物补足与债权转让\">三条结算路径：现金净额、实物补足与债权转让</h2><p><strong>现金净额结算对保障工具要求最低</strong>：周期末按净头寸轧差，用可自由兑换货币经银行清算体系划转。难点在<strong>净头寸计价口径必须与保函计价口径一致</strong>——若清算价用协定汇率、保函赔付用市场汇率，两率背离就出现覆盖缺口。设保函名义金额 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span>、市场汇率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、协定清算汇率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，实际覆盖率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>real</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{real}} = G (e_c / e_m) / E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">real</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 被人为高估时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>real</mtext></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{real}} &lt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">real</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，保函名义上「够」而赔付换回的硬通货不足，这是易货保函最常见的隐性缩水。</p>\n<p><strong>实物补足的清偿标的是货物本身</strong>，保障工具必须解决两个普通保函不面对的问题：<strong>替代性</strong>（对方无约定货物时能否用等价物抵偿）与<strong>处置能力</strong>（赔付后拿到滞销库存，等于把信用风险换成市场风险）。做法是在保障文件里预设「替代货物清单 + 折价公式」，或要求对方提供可即时变现的担保物；保障额度通常按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.2</mn><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.2 E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 计提，多出的 20% 覆盖处置折扣。</p>\n<p><strong>债权转让（switch trading）风险最高</strong>：一方累积的清算债权在本国花不出去时，折价转让给需要该国货物或货币的第三方。保障形态很特殊——<strong>受让方要求「追索权保留」（with recourse）</strong>，即债权无法变现时原债权人须回购；或由银行出具「债权变现保函」，承诺在约定期限内以约定折价率买断。经典失败是保函只覆盖「债权真实性」不覆盖「债权可售性」。</p>\n<p>三条路径并非互斥，成熟结构会写入<strong>路径优先级与转换条件</strong>，例如「差额先试现金结清；现金通道受制裁阻断时转实物补足；实物补足超期 90 天进入债权转让」——把转换条件前置写死，等于是把政治问题降级为技术问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"履约保障工具矩阵\">履约保障工具矩阵</h2><p>可用的保障工具远不止「保函」一种，选择依据是暴露的持续时间、是否需要独立性（见索即付）、违约方可追索资产的位置。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>法律性质</th>\n<th>独立性</th>\n<th>典型成本</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>履约保函（performance bond）</td>\n<td>银行担保</td>\n<td>视条款</td>\n<td>保额 0.5%–2%/年</td>\n<td>单笔大额交货的先履约保护</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>备用信用证（SBLC）</td>\n<td>独立承诺（ISP98/UCP600）</td>\n<td>强独立</td>\n<td>保额 0.3%–1.5%/年</td>\n<td>跨法域、美式市场默认选择</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>见索即付保函（URDG 758）</td>\n<td>独立担保</td>\n<td>强独立</td>\n<td>保额 0.5%–2%/年</td>\n<td>欧陆/中东/新兴市场主流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预付款保函（APG）</td>\n<td>银行担保</td>\n<td>独立</td>\n<td>与预付金额挂钩</td>\n<td>对方先付款、我方须履约</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>现金保证金 / 托管账户</td>\n<td>物权/信托安排</td>\n<td>不适用</td>\n<td>资金占用成本</td>\n<td>小额，或作为保函补充层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>母公司/集团担保</td>\n<td>保证（suretyship）</td>\n<td>从属</td>\n<td>资本占用</td>\n<td>对方为集团子公司时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>库存质押 / 存货融资</td>\n<td>物权担保</td>\n<td>不适用</td>\n<td>融资利率</td>\n<td>实物补足、对方有可查封库存</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>两个实务判断值得记住。<strong>其一，SBLC 与 URDG 758 保函功能高度重叠，但服从不同规则体系</strong>：SBLC 受 ISP98（ICC Publication 590）或 UCP 600 管辖；URDG 758 保函受 ICC《见索即付保函统一规则》（ICC Publication No. 758，2010 年修订版）管辖。URDG 758 要求索赔附「违约声明」（statement of breach），银行审单期限为 <strong>5 个营业日</strong>；UCP 600 项下同样为 <strong>5 个银行营业日</strong>；超期未拒付即丧失拒付权。</p>\n<p><strong>其二，独立保函的效力依赖准据法承认</strong>。联合国《独立担保与备用信用证公约》提供跨境承认基础，但批准国有限；跨境易货保函必须同时写清<strong>管辖法律 + 争议解决地 + 保函适用规则版本</strong>，三者缺一，赔付时可能被基础合同抗辩而冻结。</p>\n<h2 id=\"见索即付机制与保函条款的七个关键变量\">见索即付机制与保函条款的七个关键变量</h2><p>「见索即付」不是保函的天然属性，而是七个条款选择的产物；任一变量写错，独立保函就退化为须先打官司才能拿钱的有条件担保。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>变量</th>\n<th>独立保函的写法</th>\n<th>退化写法（须避免）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>付款条件</td>\n<td>凭书面索赔 + 违约声明即付</td>\n<td>须提交仲裁裁决/法院判决</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>声明内容</td>\n<td>受益人单方声明违约事实</td>\n<td>须第三方机构确认违约</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>审单期限</td>\n<td>明确 5 个营业日</td>\n<td>未约定或过长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>金额</td>\n<td>明确上限 + 币种 + 是否可循环</td>\n<td>只写「按实际损失」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有效期</td>\n<td>固定到期日或「展期或付款」</td>\n<td>与基础合同「同期限」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>转让性</td>\n<td>明确可否转让/让渡</td>\n<td>沉默</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>准据法/管辖</td>\n<td>明确规则版本 + 管辖地</td>\n<td>留白</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>「<strong>展期或付款</strong>」（extend or pay）条款对易货尤为关键：履约周期跨年、双方仍在谈补货时，受益人可在到期前要求银行要么展期要么立即赔付，把「继续挂账」的主动权交到受益人手里。申请人则要求「到期自动递减」让保额随履约比例下降，即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>G</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>new</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G(t) = G_0 (1 - \\theta(t)) + E_{\\text{new}}(t) \\le G_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">new</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。银行接受的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 上限通常不高于年度对等贸易额的 30%–50%。</p>\n<h2 id=\"结算时点-价格调整与差额清算\">结算时点、价格调整与差额清算</h2><p>保障工具解决「对方不履约」，结算机制解决「双方都履约了、钱货怎么合拢」。核心是<strong>结算时点与价格调整联动</strong>：清算价通常在签约时锁定而实物交割跨越数月，若期间大宗商品价格剧烈波动，锁定价对一方变得明显不公，履约意愿随之下降。成熟协议会设<strong>价格调整公式</strong>，把清算价挂到公开指数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_t = P_0 (1 + \\alpha \\cdot (I_t - I_0)/I_0)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是约定的现货或期货指数（如 LME 金属价、普氏能源指数、FAO 食品价格指数），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 是分担系数（常见 0.5–1.0，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha &lt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 意味着双方共担波动）；指数须注意<strong>可操纵性</strong>——小众指数易被库存操作影响。</p>\n<p>结算时点有三个可叠加的设计：<strong>阈值触发</strong>（净头寸超摆动额度即结算，最常见）、<strong>日历触发</strong>（每月/每两月固定结算，如亚洲清算联盟 ACU 采用双月周期）、<strong>事件触发</strong>（里程碑交货后强制轧差），叠加时以先行触发者为准。价格公式必须与结算时点写在一起，否则会出现「价格按签约日锁定、结算按交割日执行」的时间错配。最后的对账核销同样须前置：记价时点、汇率折算、手续费归属差异会产生「对账差额」（reconciliation break），小额差异（如低于 0.5%）由双边定期核销、超阈值则冻结结算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"制裁-外汇管制与保障失效的断裂点\">制裁、外汇管制与保障失效的断裂点</h2><p>易货长期存在很大程度是为绕开制裁、外汇管制与硬通货短缺，而这些环境恰恰是保障最容易失效之处，断裂点有三类。</p>\n<p><strong>第一类：保函开立行本身被制裁或切断通道。</strong> 若申请人开户行被列入 OFAC 特别指定国民名单（SDN List）或被排除于 SWIFT 报文体系，保函无法按常规路径通知、索赔与赔付，保障名义上存在、实际无法执行。对策是选择<strong>第三国、无制裁关联的银行</strong>作开立行，并约定可替代的报文与结算通道。</p>\n<p><strong>第二类：付款通道被切断，但保障工具假设了付款通道。</strong> 许多保函赔付条款隐含「经美元清算体系支付」，一旦该体系对交易方关闭，赔付无法落地；做法是在保函中写入<strong>币种与通道替代条款</strong>，如「赔付以美元计价，若美元通道不可用，按约定汇率以人民币或欧元经 CIPS 等替代通道支付」。</p>\n<p><strong>第三类：本币封闭用途导致债权不可用。</strong> 当对方国家实行严格外汇管制、清算债权只能在其境内使用时，保障赔付即使成功，拿到的也是「花不出去的钱」；这只能靠结构设计解决：<strong>要求保障标的为可自由兑换货币或第三国资产</strong>。印度储备银行 2022 年 7 月 11 日发布的 A.P. (DIR Series) Circular No. 10 建立了「印度卢比国际贸易结算机制」，允许境外银行开立 Special Rupee Vostro Account（SRVA），但卢比余额用途被严格限定，导致部分贸易伙伴累积大量难以使用的卢比，最终仍需回到实物补足或债权转让路径清算。</p>\n<p>合规层面还有一条硬约束：<strong>受益人与申请人主体必须与制裁筛查结果一致</strong>；一旦事后发现受益人被制裁，银行可能依法冻结赔付，而申请人已交货、彻底暴露，因此应在结构设计阶段完成对双方主体、开立行与通道银行的筛查。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>保障额度匹配暴露形状</strong>：先履约方累计敞口 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 决定保额下限，风险系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span> 随结算路径在 0.1–1.0 间浮动，现金净额最低、实物补足最高。</li>\n<li><strong>独立保函的独立性来自七个条款</strong>：付款条件、声明内容、审单期限、金额定义、有效期与展期条款、转让性、准据法与管辖，任一写错都退化为须先诉讼的有条件担保。</li>\n<li><strong>URDG 758 与 ISP98/UCP 600 并行</strong>：前者要求索赔附违约声明、审单 5 个营业日；后者用于备用信用证，审单同为 5 个银行营业日。</li>\n<li><strong>汇率口径不一致是隐性缩水</strong>：清算价用协定汇率、保函赔付用市场汇率时，实际覆盖率可能低于 1。</li>\n<li><strong>价格公式与结算时点必须联动</strong>：清算价挂公开指数并设分担系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>，并明确阈值/日历/事件触发条件的优先级。</li>\n<li><strong>制裁与外汇管制是真实断裂点</strong>：开立行被制裁、通道被切断、债权封闭用途三类失效无法靠条款修补，只能在结构设计阶段对冲。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"易货结算路径与履约保障安排","id":"易货结算路径与履约保障安排"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：结算路径与保障工具是一对耦合变量","id":"核心概念-结算路径与保障工具是一对耦合变量"},{"level":2,"text":"三条结算路径：现金净额、实物补足与债权转让","id":"三条结算路径-现金净额-实物补足与债权转让"},{"level":2,"text":"履约保障工具矩阵","id":"履约保障工具矩阵"},{"level":2,"text":"见索即付机制与保函条款的七个关键变量","id":"见索即付机制与保函条款的七个关键变量"},{"level":2,"text":"结算时点、价格调整与差额清算","id":"结算时点-价格调整与差额清算"},{"level":2,"text":"制裁、外汇管制与保障失效的断裂点","id":"制裁-外汇管制与保障失效的断裂点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"易货商品估值与等价性核验方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/countertrade-barter-offset-operations/barter-clearing-settlement/barter-goods-valuation-verification"},"next":{"title":"抵销类型与信用乘数模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/countertrade-barter-offset-operations/offset-obligation-execution/offset-types-credit-multiplier"}}